  "critical_findings": [
    "World is a mutable secondary scene container, not a canonical dynamic state.",
    "PhysicsWorld, FluidSystem and AcousticSystem own solver-private state without versioned publication.",
    "NativeSimulationContract has useful rational time and coupling semantics but no executable transfer graph.",
    "RenderSession retains SceneIR and scene_epoch but no world_state/time/observation_snapshot identity.",
    "SceneDiff is the correct transactional seed but its dependency and invalidation model is too narrow."
  ]
